				    {
				    {"Case-manage high-risk patients in the most-deprived neighbourhoods", "🟢 On track", "In progress", "PHM team + PCNs", "Cut avoidable emergency demand in the top-risk cohort", 800000, "—  (foundational)", "Q2 2026 → Q3 2026", "Cohort lists issued to PCNs — Q2", 1},
				    {"Close clinical gaps in deprived practices (untreated AF, missed national targets)", "🟠 At risk", "Scoping", "Primary Care", "Anticoagulation + screening uplift; fewer strokes and avoidable spend", 450000, "Risk cohort lists (Action 1)", "Q3 2026 → Q4 2026", "Practice-level gap packs — Q3", 2},
